    crm:P183i_has_representation <https://ids.lib.harvard.edu/ids/iiif/493312310/full/full/0/default.jpg> ;
    rdf:value """Tuesday Nov. 3. 1903. New Haven House. New Haven
We spent the day taking notes on the gallery - It is an interesting one, and there are 14 pictures we should gladly own.
Gentile da Fabriano Madonna.
Neroccio Annunciation.
Pollajuolo, Hercules and Deianira
P. Lorenzetti: Assunta
5 & 6. Sassetta Temptations of Antony
Simone Martini - St. Martin
Benvenuto [di Giovanni], Madonna
Benvenuto [di Giovanni], Love Bound 
Girolamo da Cremona. Nativity.
Ghirlandajo Woman’s Head
Sano, Ad[oration] of Magi
Sano, Coronation
Giovanni di Paolo.
Usual complement of professors in gallery. Miss Hale - who is awfully nice - came in afternoon. Mr. Jackson took us to a tea at the Country Club, where lots of people were introduced to us."""^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 40 ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:part_of <https://mbdiaries.itatti.harvard.edu/resource/diary/1903-04> .

